<section xml:id="manual-2.0-ROOT-install.requirements"><title>Requirements</title>
<orderedlist numeration="arabic"><listitem><para>Download the archive.</para></listitem><listitem><para>Unpack it:</para><orderedlist numeration="loweralpha"><listitem><para>on Linux, with <literal>tar</literal>;</para></listitem><listitem><para>on Windows, with Explorer.</para></listitem></orderedlist>
