<section xml:id="manual-2.0-ROOT-install._steps"><title>Steps</title>
<para>The steps come from a partial.</para>
<warning><para>NESTED-PARTIAL-MARKER: a partial included by another partial.</para>
</warning>
<formalpara><title>Starting the service</title><para><programlisting language="sh">systemctl start product<co xml:id="manual-2.0-ROOT-install.co1-1-1"/></programlisting></para></formalpara>
<calloutlist><callout arearefs="manual-2.0-ROOT-install.co1-1-1"><para>Starts it now.</para></callout></calloutlist>
<para>Special characters stay text: Ünïcødé, "quotes", 'apostrophes’, &amp; &lt;angle brackets&gt;, and 3 &gt; 2.</para>
